     },
     "claim": "At None of 2 February the Office sings the short responsory Elégit eam and then the versicle Diffúsa est grátia in lábiis tuis with its response Proptérea benedíxit te Deus in ætérnum; the feast thus applies this verse to Mary. This supports the reading of te and tuis on this feast, not a rule for every use of Psalm 44:3."
